@startuml 03_player_state
!include ../../style.iuml
title Player (session) state machine

state CONNECTED : not logged in\naccepts: REGISTER, LOGIN
state IDLE : in "my room" (home screen)\naccepts: LIST_ONLINE, ADD_FRIEND, FIND_MATCH,\nINVITE, ACCEPT_INVITE, DECLINE_INVITE,\nLEADERBOARD, LOGOUT
state SEARCHING : in random or ranked queue\naccepts: CANCEL_MATCH
state PLAYING : in a game room given by the server\naccepts: MOVE, OFFER_DRAW, ACCEPT_DRAW,\nDECLINE_DRAW, RESIGN, LEAVE_GAME

[*] --> CONNECTED : TCP connection accepted
CONNECTED --> CONNECTED : REGISTER /\nLOGIN fails /\nalready logged in
CONNECTED --> IDLE : LOGIN ok\n(my room is created)
IDLE --> SEARCHING : FIND_MATCH|RANDOM\nor FIND_MATCH|RANKED
SEARCHING --> IDLE : CANCEL_MATCH
SEARCHING --> PLAYING : MATCH_FOUND\n(server creates game room)
IDLE --> PLAYING : invitation accepted\n(server creates game room)
PLAYING --> IDLE : GAME_OVER\n(back to my room)
IDLE --> [*] : LOGOUT\n(my room is deleted)

note right of PLAYING
  Connection lost while PLAYING:
  the player loses immediately.
  Connection lost in other states:
  session and room are removed.
end note
note left of CONNECTED
  A message not accepted in the
  current state gets
  ERROR|INVALID_STATE
end note
@enduml
